Hey!! 🎉 So I just wrapped up 5,000 stress cycles on my watchdog module and it literally did not miss a single heartbeat — I'm honestly so pumped right now!!

Here's the core loop:

```c
while (1) {
    if (check_telemetry_timeout()) {
        pet_watchdog();
        continue;
    }
    if (process_telemetry_frame() == BACKPRESSURE) {
        adaptive_fallback_timeout();
        pet_watchdog();
        continue;
    }
    pet_watchdog();
}
```

Clean, tight, handles everything. Adaptive fallback means even under load it keeps the hardware timer alive — no resets, no missed deadlines.

